{"server":"tw","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_01_end","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_01","title":"注意事項","storyCode":"RS-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"92a3ad96978f634676ae85322767f7efa3d4fc716881f59248b42102bfb11fbf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的記憶中有一片茫茫白雪\n我記得小的時候，我躺在木頭做的小床上，屋內壁爐裡的柴火劈啪作響，窗外漫天大雪徹夜不停。\n風聲在耳畔呼呼作響，一隻大手撫著我的頭，有人低聲哄我入睡。\n我就在暖暖的安心感中沉入夢鄉。\n我曾一度以為，那是烏薩斯。\n媽媽卻告訴我，不是的，羅莎琳，那不是烏薩斯。\n那是謝拉格的風。\n那是謝拉格的雪。\n那是……我出生的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g3_traincarriage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……羅莎琳你是一直到上高等學校，才知道自己其實是在謝拉格出生的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，我媽之前完全沒提過還有這回事，最開始我還以為她在開玩笑呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候的事我都忘得差不多了，就記得到處都是雪……烏薩斯不也到處都是雪嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這誰分得清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這麼說的話確實是有幾分相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在我的記憶裡，烏薩斯比謝拉格要更冷點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……這倒是沒錯，確實還是烏薩斯更冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你也去過烏薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，都是好多年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候沒什麼機會好好逛逛，可惜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你下次再來，我來當你嚮導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯別的不說，聖駿堡的景色還是一等一的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，呃，看來我得多準備兩件厚外套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在有機會去烏薩斯赴約之前，還是先讓我為羅莎琳小姐做嚮導吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就先說說這輛車的目的地——新建的那座耶拉岡德像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它就建在銀心湖的湖心島上，十分顯眼，一出車站立刻就能看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，對羅莎琳你來說，耶拉岡德像還不是重點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的這趟謝拉格之旅，有比觀光更重要的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要先替我媽看一眼耶拉岡德像，這是她……她走之前強調過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我就轉道去銀心湖旁邊的那座山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得把這個盒子裡的東西，送到那座山的山頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡面是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，我媽沒跟我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只讓我把這個丟到那座山上，這樣她就能心滿意足了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孤身一人回到陌生的故鄉，只為完成母親的願望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼孝順，多麼好的孩子，真是令人感動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，也沒有你說的這麼誇張啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，在那之後羅莎琳你的計劃是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把東西送上山之後？沒什麼具體的計劃，可能四處逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能……會去找我爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父親還在謝拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是尋人，或許我能幫得上忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？可是我不知道他的名字，也記不得他長什麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我媽跟我說過，我爸長得很好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，一位美男子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！據說是當時謝拉格有名有姓的美男子，好像還挺有名氣的嘞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我媽還說過，我的眼睛最像我爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格的有名人？美男子？唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人選？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那位先生能生出羅莎琳你這個年紀的女兒，那麼只能是在維多利亞留學期間……唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不不不。再怎麼說也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時，烏薩斯，難道說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，哈哈，我得再尋思尋思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能找到他那最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來一場令人感動的父女相認？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是要看看，這個十多年沒出現的混帳東西到底是個什麼樣的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎各位乘坐最新的“聖女號”列車，我們的列車正處於正常行駛中，您可以透過兩側的車窗觀賞謝拉格美麗的自然風光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在列車行駛過程中，我們還將在車內特別進行謝拉格當地特產的售賣活動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格特色乳酪零食及人氣馱獸盲盒均有販賣，更有喀蘭貿易公司推出的精裝版高山雪水限量發售，產地直銷，聖女嚴選，品質有保障！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有需要的乘客可以自由選購……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，請問一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這位乘客，請問您想來點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是要看商品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不要看普通商品？那這款精裝版高山雪水要看一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這款產品是三族議會的指定用水，聖女大人也非常喜愛呢，我們這班車到貨不多，非常難得，現在購買只需四弗朗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看熱鬧的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……四弗朗？這都夠我下館子請客吃一頓了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是貴了一點，但您看這包裝，這純淨的感覺，特別符合先生您的氣質！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就要……這個盲盒吧，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝惠顧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離下一站到站還有多長時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次列車為直達列車，下一站就是終點站銀心湖了，中間不會停靠其他站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離到站還有兩個小時！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想在中途下車，更加深入地觀覽沿線的風光，我們的線路上也有每站停車的車次可供選擇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（盲盒？這小東西這麼受歡迎嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不管怎麼看，都只不過是個沒什麼意思的小擺飾罷了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……還有兩個小時，時間就夠了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下來……嗯？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羽獸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（狠啄）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽獸們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（滿地亂飛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽獸們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（四處攻擊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽獸們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吃驚的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我的羽獸！我的羽獸怎麼都跑出來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡呢！我來幫你抓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘氣的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，我也想去抓羽獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……不好。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘氣的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，叔叔！叔叔你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘氣的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔也一起來幫忙好不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘氣的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓羽獸太好玩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……呼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小小羽獸和幼兒相加，竟會有如此威力。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（謝拉格確實不可小覷。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過，這倒正好給了我一個檢查車廂的正當理由。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，先生們，請問這裡有人看到過逃走的羽獸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有？好的，抱歉打擾了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒有異常。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（前面的車廂都沒有可疑之處，現在只剩下最後幾個包廂。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來這次很可能又是白跑一趟了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾一下，請問……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g3_traincarriage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……要是找到人，我要跟他算算這十多年的帳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這個，在來之前我拜託娜塔莉婭和安娜……就是我的兩個朋友，我拜託她們都幫我算好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活費、教育費、醫療費，哦對還有情感缺席費——娜塔莉婭特別提出來的——都列出來在這了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算長得再帥也不管用！臉又不能當飯吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，情感缺席費，不錯，真不錯，我支持！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗯？哪位，請……\n進……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外國佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請問這裡有人看到過逃走的羽獸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羽獸？哦，之前確實看到了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對對對！我們確實看到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生，來來來，我們出去詳細說說羽獸的事兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？這有什麼好詳細說的，哎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼啊，奇奇怪怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……維多利亞啊。但願沒什麼大事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，先生，現在我們聊聊羽獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，什麼樣的羽獸，才能勞動“灰禮帽”親自來找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到子爵閣下也在車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，算了吧，先生，這是我的台詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼不知道，“灰禮帽”什麼時候也開始對觀光感興趣了。難道說……是你的提前退休申請終於被批准了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下不必如此試探。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過隱約聽到一些風聲，按照慣例排查而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話我可不敢輕易相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您與我同為公爵閣下分憂，彼此應該多些信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下又為什麼會出現在這裡？剛剛在您身邊的那位女士……是一名烏薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女士看起來似乎有點眼熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰禮帽”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須要說，你這種搭訕女士的方式很過時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有這個意思，但還是感謝提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我，自然是為了觀光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，注意你的語氣，“多些信任”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩天後就是耶拉岡德像的落成儀式，邀請函都送到我這來了，提前參觀一下也是應有之義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還買了兩個聖女小雕像，準備當天一起帶去，那東西做得挺好看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，聊天時間結束，我這裡沒有什麼……“羽獸”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也該繼續工作了，“灰禮帽”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也一樣，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您沒有忘記我們為什麼會在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是最後一間。沒有其他異常。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（除了，克雷加文子爵和他身邊的那個女孩……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（出現在子爵身邊……她會是什麼身分？看來回去之後，應該好好查一查。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過，現在還是先查完這一間——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失禮了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報裡提到那個人正在山中訓練新兵，不可能會在這裡出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該不會是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有事就說，開門好玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然真的是她……？！那個希瓦艾什家的黑騎士……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有手上的血跡，是誰讓她動手了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……有麻煩了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過，這也說明情報沒有錯，這條線路上的列車確實有問題。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，在考慮這個問題之前……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一批負責觀察鐧的行動的情報員是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然連這樣重要的情報都沒能掌握，這幾個人，等著去軍事法庭作報告吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說情報員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別怪他們，能追上我的人不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您為他們說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實話而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，你在這做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該不會還沒想好理由吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰禮帽”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
